  "body_markdown": "Skip to content\n\nDental Implants\n\nDental Implant Surgery\n\nAll-on-4 Dental Implants\n\nFixed Teeth vs. Removable\n\nCost & Compare\n\nDental Implant FAQ\n\nAesthetics\n\nCosmetic Dentistry\n\nPorcelain Veneers\n\nDental Crowns & Bridges\n\nSmile Makeover\n\nTeeth Whitening\n\nTreatments\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nOral Surgery\n\nEmergency Dentistry\n\nConditions We Treat\n\nWhat To Expect\n\nPatient Center\n\nInsurance & Financing\n\nSmile Gallery\n\nWho We Are\n\nWhy Choose Us\n\nMeet Dr. Esam Nahlah\n\nMeet The Team\n\nVideo Library\n\nPatient Stories\n\nFor Doctors\n\nReferral Form\n\nContact Us\n\nBlog\n\nCurrent Patients\n\nTysons Corner: (703) 448-3312\n\nAlexandria: (703) 940-5410\n\nNew Patients\n\nTysons Corner: (571) 619-9442\n\nAlexandria: (571) 410-3430\n\nBook now\n\n\n## Book Now\n\n\n\n## Book Now\n\n\n\n## Complete Teeth Replacement: The Perks of Dental Implants Explained\n\n\nJuly 14, 2024\n\n\n#### Share This Post\n\n\nWhat exactly is the dental implant process, you ask? It involves surgically implanting this prosthetic root into the jawbone and affixing a crown on top to simulate a natural tooth. This process requires precision and expertise, transforming smiles one implant at a time.\n\nWhen you visit us in McLean, VA, for your dental implant procedure, we ensure each step is handled meticulously. Our trustworthy team will guide you through the entire journey, from evaluation to post-operative check-ups. We prioritize your safety and satisfaction, reinforced by our committed and skilled professionals.\n\n\n## Getting The Proper Care You Need\n\n\nBut why choose dental implants in McLean, VA? Apart from the aesthetically pleasing results, dental implants are also beneficial for oral health. They also have admirable longevity, potentially lasting a lifetime with proper care. Plus, unlike some alternatives, they are incredibly durable, allowing you to eat and speak without fear of shifting or dislodging.\n\nDental implants help preserve bone structure in the jaw, preventing deterioration that can occur with other tooth replacement options. This not only maintains facial aesthetics but also promotes overall oral health.\n\n\n## The Need for Complete Teeth Replacement\n\n\nPoor oral health, decay, or sudden accidents can sometimes lead to tooth loss. This isn’t just distressing—it’s also potentially detrimental to your nutrition, speech, and self-esteem. The good news? Dental implants can virtually turn back time, restoring appeal and functionality to your mouth.\n\nDental implants are a remarkable solution that replaces missing teeth and provides stability and strength to your jawbone. By mimicking the natural tooth structure, they offer a long-term, durable option to significantly enhance your quality of life. Dental implants can transform oral health and well-being, whether you enjoy your favorite foods without worry, speak confidently, or smile without hesitation.\n\n\n## Comparing Dental Implants to Other Teeth Replacement Options\n\n\nUpon comparing dental implants to other options like dentures and bridges, you may find that while the upfront cost may be higher, the long-term value is indisputable. For one, they look and feel far more natural. They also don’t require the same maintenance or replacements, making them cost-effective in the long run.\n\nAre you ready to restore your smile with dental implants at our skilled and trusted dental practice? Please don’t wait to get the smile of your dreams with us. Contact Dr. Nahlah, and our exceptional team at our implant practice in McLean, VA to schedule an appointment today!\n\nPrevPreviousRevamp Your Smile: Understanding the Basics of Tooth Implants in McLean, VA\n\nNextUnraveling the Complexities: Complications in Implant DentistryNext\n\n\n#### More To Explore\n\n\n\n### Unlock the Benefits of Dental Implants: Your Best Teeth Replacement Option\n\n\nTooth loss can become an unfortunate reality for many as we age. Thankfully, advancements in dental technology, like dental implants,\n\nRead More »\n\nOctober 26, 2024\n\n\n### Your Comprehensive Guide on Dental Implants: The Best Replacement of Tooth Solution\n\n\nDental implants in McLean, VA are small, and titanium posts are surgically placed in your jawbone underneath your gum line.\n\nOctober 20, 2024\n\n\n## You Are Welcome Here.\n\n\nSchedule your consultation today.\n\nFacebook Instagram Youtube Google\n\n\n#### Contact Us\n\n\nAddresses:\n\nTysons Corner\n\n7901 Jones Branch Dr., Suite 220\n\nMcLean, VA 22102\n\nNew Patients: (571) 619-9442\n\nCurrent Patients: (703) 448-3312\n\nAlexandria\n\n2855 Duke St,\n\nAlexandria, VA 22314\n\nNew Patients: (571) 410-3430\n\nCurrent Patients: (703) 940-5410\n\n\n#### Hours\n\n\nMonday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nTuesday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nWednesday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nThursday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nFriday: 8:00am – 2:00pm\n\nSaturday: Closed\n\nSunday: Closed\n\n\n#### Services\n\n\nAll-On-4® Implants\n\nCrowns & Bridges\n\n\n#### About Us\n\n\nMeet the Doctor\n\nAbout Us\n\nBefore & After Photos\n\n2025 Dr. Nahlah. All rights reserved",
